      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAWBOURNE DOLLAR (1) turned in a moderate performance last time when seventh at this track over 320m behind Phoenix Umbrella (18.91) in a Grade 4/5. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Should bounce back. SONALI (2) had second look this course and distance latest and improved on his time, finishing a 14 length third in 30.73. In form and must include in calculations. CAWBOURNE LADY (7) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 5.5 lengths win at this track in a handy 30.11. Draws out wide but goes well at this distance. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Leading player again. KIWI JAY (5) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
